Value Filldown MODE (\S+)
Value Filldown ROOT_BRIDGE_FOR (.+?)
Value Required INSTANCE (\S+)
Value BLOCKING (\d+)
Value LISTENING (\d+)
Value LEARNING (\d+)
Value FORWARDING (\d+)
Value STP_ACTIVE (\d+)

Start
  ^Switch\s+is\s+in\s+${MODE}\s+mode\s*$$
  ^Root\s+bridge\s+for:\s*${ROOT_BRIDGE_FOR}\s*$$
  ^\s*Name\s+Blocking\s+Listening\s+Learning\s+Forwarding\s+STP\s+Active\s*$$ -> Table
  ^.*$$

Table
  ^\s*-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${INSTANCE}\s+${BLOCKING}\s+${LISTENING}\s+${LEARNING}\s+${FORWARDING}\s+${STP_ACTIVE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
